<http://data.silknow.org/object/0c8e98bb-ee5f-32d0-a77a-d6afae6c272e>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Dress fabric of woven silk, Iran, 1860-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of woven silk, weft-faced twill.\nHussein Kuli Khan type.\nStripes, from left to right:\n[1] partial stripe, dark blue ground with green meander and red flower;\n[2] wider stripe; red ground with an angular dark blue meander incorporating a yellow leaf and bearing white stems with white and dark blue petalled flower and two leaves.\n[3] repeat of [1]\n[4] Widest stripe; white ground with undulating red and yellow stem with dark blue serrated outline. This encloses a boteh-shaped arrangement of a pair of leaves and a floral stem in red outlined in dark blue.\nRepeat of [1] and a tiny part of [2] in the lower right hand corner.\nWarp: white silk.\nWeft: red, white, yellow silk, all Z-twist and dark blue silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/d3a471bf-24ac-3239-9bf4-1a42126c86bf> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Dress fabric of woven silk, Iran, 1860-1899"@en , "Dress fabric of woven silk, weft-faced twill.\nHussein Kuli Khan type.\nStripes, from left to right:\n[1] partial stripe, dark blue ground with green meander and red flower;\n[2] wider stripe; red ground with an angular dark blue meander incorporating a yellow leaf and bearing white stems with white and dark blue petalled flower and two leaves.\n[3] repeat of [1]\n[4] Widest stripe; white ground with undulating red and yellow stem with dark blue serrated outline. This encloses a boteh-shaped arrangement of a pair of leaves and a floral stem in red outlined in dark blue.\nRepeat of [1] and a tiny part of [2] in the lower right hand corner.\nWarp: white silk.\nWeft: red, white, yellow silk, all Z-twist and dark blue silk."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/0c8e98bb-ee5f-32d0-a77a-d6afae6c272e/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/0c8e98bb-ee5f-32d0-a77a-d6afae6c272e/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/0c8e98bb-ee5f-32d0-a77a-d6afae6c272e/dimension/1> ;
